Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{op spot}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.67,Flashback,Ray,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.51,0:00:28.38,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Ray... You have...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.63,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,to live.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.49,0:00:55.12,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Is that... overheating?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.88,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,It really is huge.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.01,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.85,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Which way is the auditorium?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.94,0:02:44.89,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.69,0:02:46.69,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,domniță.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.94,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,Oh, vai. Este în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.86,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure it's a good idea to \Nsuddenly stop in the middle of the path.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.37,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Îmi cer scuze. E prima oară când vin aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.62,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,What? But didn't all new students \Nmove onto campus two days ago?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.58,0:03:08.38,Dialogue,Laquis,0,0,0,,I heard there'd be just one moving in \Non the day of the entrance ceremony!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.59,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,One who descends from neither \Naristocrat nor sorcerer,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.59,0:03:13.21,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,but is born of an ordinary family.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.51,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,Ordinary?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.47,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,Wait, that's him?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.47,0:03:18.68,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,First one since the school \Nwas founded, I heard.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.72,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Pretty bold for an ordinary.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.72,0:03:21.39,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Did he get in on connections?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.93,0:03:23.39,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,I-I can't believe an \N{\i1}ordinary{\i0} just touched me...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.93,0:03:24.48,Dialogue,Laquis,0,0,0,,Wanda!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.19,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,Wanda! Keep it together!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.94,Dialogue,Laquis,0,0,0,,It's okay! Everything's okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.94,0:03:29.31,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,Wanda!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.94,0:03:29.94,Main - Top,Albert,0,0,0,,So you're Ray White?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.15,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.19,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Albert Alium.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.53,0:03:37.86,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm Ray White. May I call you "Mr. Alium"?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.45,0:03:41.28,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Only nobles are allowed \Nto attend this school,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.28,0:03:45.00,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,or, at the very least, \Nthose descended from sorcerers.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.37,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,That's because the Arnold Academy of Sorcery
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.42,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,has ancient and honorable \Norigins as a school for nobles!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.42,0:03:52.92,Dialogue,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right! Totally right!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.92,0:03:55.67,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,I don't know what strings \Nyou pulled to get here,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.67,0:03:59.64,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,but this is no place for \Nan ordinary like you!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.64,0:04:00.97,Dialogue,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,You tell 'im!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.30,0:04:05.81,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate. There are many \Nthings I want to learn at this academy.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.02,0:04:07.23,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Why, youâ€”
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.61,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,You worthless ordinary!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.86,0:04:12.94,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.82,0:04:14.73,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.11,Dialogue,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Whoa! She's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.70,0:04:22.58,Dialogue,Zuina,0,0,0,,From one of the top three noble families.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.87,0:04:25.37,Dialogue,Zuina,0,0,0,,Al, maybe you should stop...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.62,0:04:26.95,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,Lady Rose!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.79,0:04:29.00,Dialogue,Jeryl/Laquis,0,0,0,,She's such a treasure!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.46,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Rose?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.50,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.21,0:04:36.67,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,I will never accept an ordinary like you!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.93,Main - Top,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait up, Al!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.59,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.18,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.97,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm Amelia Rose.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.56,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Rose.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:49.23,0:04:50.69,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.69,0:04:52.10,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Feel free to call me "Ray."
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.44,0:04:55.44,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,And you can call me "Amelia," as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.44,0:04:59.36,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're the first ordinary \Nto attend this academy.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.70,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,That's a big deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.99,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Clearly, your talents have been recognized.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.49,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I couldn't be more grateful.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.49,0:05:05.83,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,So, Ray...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.83,0:05:06.83,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.50,0:05:10.75,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,If you have any problems \Nat all, you can talk to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.34,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Now, a word from our principal.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.68,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Welcome, students.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.31,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,The Arnold Academy of Sorcery
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.31,0:05:30.39,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,is among the finest schools in the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.73,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,All of you who stand here today
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.90,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,have been acknowledged for \Nyour talents as sorcerers.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.15,0:05:39.57,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,But do not be prideful. \NHard work is still a must.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.40,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Spare no blood, sweat, or tears.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.70,0:05:46.78,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,One's skills are a product of their innate \Ntalent, environment, and hard work.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.29,0:05:50.08,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Many sorcerers, despite remarkable \Ntalents and favorable environments,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.29,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,lose heart and let their \Nabilities waste away.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.09,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Thus, I tell you this:
Dialogue: 99,0:05:56.75,0:06:00.30,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Put in the effort to become \Nfirst-rate sorcerers.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.63,0:06:07.18,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,I am Abbie Garnet, the principal \Nof the Arnold Academy of Sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.26,0:06:09.47,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.93,0:06:12.73,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Thank you for that speech, Principal.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.02,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.69,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,a word from the representative \Nof incoming students.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.03,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I am Amelia Rose, \Nrepresentative of the incoming students.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.32,0:06:29.04,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I am proud to have been accepted \Nto this prestigious academy.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.33,0:06:33.50,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,However, this is not our destination, \Nbut rather our starting point.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.79,0:06:39.05,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm sure many difficulties \Nlie on the road ahead of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:39.55,0:06:42.92,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,But now that I am a student of this academy,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.72,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I intend to face all of them head-on.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.72,0:06:48.35,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,As the principal said a moment ago,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.64,0:06:51.35,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,to continually work hard \Nand master our sorcery
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.35,0:06:54.64,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,is the mission we have undertaken.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.85,0:06:56.90,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,That's him?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.52,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Look, it's the guy everyone's talking about.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.40,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.61,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.94,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,This is the last student to join the class,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.61,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,the one I've told you about.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.07,0:07:06.36,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.91,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,As I'm sure many of you know, \NI come from an ordinary family.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.45,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I've heard I'm the first ordinary \Nat this school since it was founded,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.12,0:07:19.63,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,but I intend to put forth my best effort \Nas a sorcerer throughout my time here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.54,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I hope we can work together.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.13,0:07:28.51,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Okay, White. Sorry to just throw you \Ninto this, but you know the situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.51,0:07:31.18,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,You can introduce yourself to \Nyour classmates individually.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.18,0:07:32.56,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, Instructor.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.35,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,It's Helena Grady. You can call me Miss Gray.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.52,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,My apologies, Instructor Gray.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.15,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Must you be so rigid?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.90,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. Go on and sit down.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.90,0:07:43.82,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.82,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Looking forward to working with you, Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.32,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Same here, Amelia.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:48.57,0:07:50.66,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,Why is Lady Rose talking to him?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.37,0:07:51.37,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Wait, why? Why?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.83,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,One of the three top families \Nis interested in him?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.29,0:07:56.83,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Ordinary...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.31,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,White!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.97,0:08:15.85,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,White!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.57,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Class is in session, White.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.74,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,You need to pay attention.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.03,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.57,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,To get back on topic...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.95,0:08:34.16,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,We were discussing sorcerer ranks.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.45,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Do you know what they are, Rose?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.79,0:08:36.58,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.96,0:08:40.75,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,There are five ranks established \Nby the Society of Sorcery:
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.25,0:08:44.42,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,bronze, silver, gold, platinum...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.67,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,and grand, the rank regarded as sacred.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.51,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.51,0:08:53.30,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Only seven grand sorcerers \Nexist at any one time.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.52,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,These seven, who have mastered \Nthe very essence of sorcery,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.52,0:08:59.06,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,are known as the seven greatest \Nsorcerers in the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.06,0:09:02.48,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,They are the pinnacle of sorcery \Nthat all sorcerers strive to match.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.98,0:09:07.28,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,The very existence of the seven greatest \Nsorcerers is shrouded in mystery,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.28,0:09:10.49,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,but a few details about them \Nare known to the public.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.74,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,First, our very own principal, Abbie Garnet,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.49,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,is the Blaze Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.95,0:09:20.25,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Next, the Spellbinding \NSorcerer, Carol Caroline.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.66,0:09:25.92,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,She's the most well-known of the \Nseven as a researcher of sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.34,0:09:30.63,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,In fact, she's just about the only one \Nwho really puts herself out there.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.88,0:09:36.89,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,And then there's the one known as \Nthe hero of the Far East War...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.89,0:09:38.89,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,The Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.10,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.90,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,The Iceblade Sorcerer is the one who vanished
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.90,0:09:45.65,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,after bringing an end to the Far East War.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.15,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Nothing is known about the rest of the seven.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.15,0:09:50.11,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Not even their aliases.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.91,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,But as I said earlier,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.91,0:09:57.79,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,so long as you attend this academy, \Nyou should be aware that the destination
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.79,0:10:02.54,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,at the end of your path is the rank of \Ngrand sorcerer, one of the great seven.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.96,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Miss Gray.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.13,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,What is it, Alium?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.21,0:10:10.09,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,If the goal we strive for is to be \None of the seven great sorcerers,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.09,0:10:13.38,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,then why is there an ordinary at this school?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.38,0:10:14.22,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.39,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Why is there an ordinary?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.39,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.89,0:10:19.89,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,The only students here are those \Nwho passed the mandated exam,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.89,0:10:24.06,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,as well as an in-person interview \Nto be approved as students.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.56,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Whether they are noble or \Nordinary means nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.56,0:10:27.36,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.28,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to practice some sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.24,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,You might not think it necessary anymore,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.24,0:10:39.16,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,but you will be starting from \Nthe most basic of exercises.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.08,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate the basics.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.08,0:10:44.62,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Even the seven great \Nsorcerers are no exception.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.62,0:10:45.71,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Now, Rose...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.71,0:10:46.17,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.17,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,What is "sorcery"?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.42,0:10:52.38,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Sorcery refers to the art of \Nreconstructing prima materia,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.38,0:10:55.55,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,the primary building block \Nof matter in our world.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.85,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Very good. That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.55,0:11:01.81,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,And at the very core of \Nsorcery is the code theory.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.98,0:11:06.60,Italics,Helena,0,0,0,,Prima materia, encoding, material code.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.61,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,First, you encode prima materia,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.61,0:11:11.44,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,or in other words, turn it into code.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.44,0:11:14.90,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,At this stage, there is still excess data.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.11,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.11,0:11:20.20,Italics,Helena,0,0,0,,Material code, decoding, material code.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.95,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,You remove the excess by decoding,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.95,0:11:26.04,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,put the data back in order, \Nand move to the processing stage.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.79,Italics,Helena,0,0,0,,Material code, processing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.76,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Here, you can add or remove more data.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.92,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Finally, you manifest it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.26,Italics,Helena,0,0,0,,Embodiment, material.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.89,0:11:41.81,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,These are the fundamentals of sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.68,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Additionally, anything you have made...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.94,0:11:49.23,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,you can also erase.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.98,0:11:54.57,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Sorcery is a theoretical phenomenon derived \Nfrom the understanding of technique.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.99,0:11:58.28,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Any questions about what \NI've explained thus far?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.49,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,I have one, ma'am.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.58,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,You do, Rose? Very well.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.08,0:12:06.16,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Are there any limits on the things \Nreconstructed by prima materia?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.58,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,No, strictly speaking, there are no limits.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.58,0:12:12.17,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,It all depends on the \Nsorcerer's own capability.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.84,0:12:17.42,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Sorcery is, primarily, the art \Nof creating matter or phenomena.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.55,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Matter can be separated into four categories.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.01,0:12:23.14,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Solids.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.60,0:12:26.77,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Liquids.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.44,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Gases.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.23,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,And finally, plasma.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.61,0:12:36.94,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Anything else is classified as a phenomenon.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.62,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.95,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.70,0:12:46.75,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,When you erased the ice roses earlier,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.75,0:12:49.33,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,did you use anti-material code?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.33,0:12:55.34,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,No. There is no sorcerer who \Nuses anti-material code.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.84,0:12:59.59,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Ainsworth's twofold code theory \Nis doctorate-level material.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.80,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Students don't need to understand it yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.31,Dialogue,Helena,0,0,0,,Now for some exercises.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.77,Italics,Amelia,0,0,0,,Prima materia, encoding.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.77,0:13:13.11,Italics,Amelia,0,0,0,,Material code.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.11,0:13:15.44,Italics,Amelia,0,0,0,,Material code, decoding.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.86,0:13:16.40,Italics - Top,Amelia,0,0,0,,Material code, processing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.94,0:13:18.94,Italics,Amelia,0,0,0,,Embodiment, material.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.07,0:13:25.53,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it, \NLady Rose! Magnificent!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.79,Main - Top,Amelia,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.66,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,Leave it to a lady of one \Nof the highest noble families.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.79,0:13:30.58,Main - Top,Wanda,0,0,0,,I love it so, so, so, so, so, so much!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.08,Main - Top,Amelia,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.58,Dialogue,Laquis,0,0,0,,On the other hand...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.67,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Hmm... I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.59,Dialogue,Wanda,0,0,0,,What was that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.42,Dialogue,Jeryl,0,0,0,,That was a child's sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.72,Dialogue,Laquis,0,0,0,,But didn't the teacher \Nsay he passed the exam?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.72,0:13:43.51,Dialogue,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,What's his deal, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.14,Dialogue,Zuina,0,0,0,,He's totally useless.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.35,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,Ordinary...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.35,0:13:51.10,Dialogue,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Whoa... Al?!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.81,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,As a member of the Alium household,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.81,0:13:59.15,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I refuse to acknowledge the existence \Nof a talentless Withered Wizard!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.32,0:14:05.20,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,This is definitely a \Nhistorical school building.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.16,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Its construction is flawless.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.75,0:14:13.83,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Looking for Ainsworth?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.83,0:14:14.92,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Huh?! Ah...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.54,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,You asked about it in class earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.71,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Oh... Um, I...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.71,0:14:22.38,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Sorry for asking out of nowhere. \NI'm Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.80,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Oh... um...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.84,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'm Elisa Griffith.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.93,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Miss Griffith.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.93,0:14:29.68,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,You can call me "Ray."
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.68,0:14:32.77,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Oh... And you can call me "Elisa."
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.10,0:14:35.65,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Once more, nice to meet you, Elisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.90,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.90,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Dr. Ainsworth is my role model.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.11,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,So that's why you asked about \Nthe twofold code theory.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.11,0:14:47.45,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want to be just like her.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.45,0:14:51.25,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,That's amazing. She's a top-ranking \Nresearcher of sorcery.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.04,0:14:54.58,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Well, it's just a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.50,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Do you like Dr. Ainsworth, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.50,0:15:01.96,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yeah. I love her from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.96,0:15:06.59,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Really?! Wow! I've never met \Nany other Ainsers my age!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.60,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Ainsers?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.39,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.01,0:15:13.48,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,That means... fans of Dr. Ainsworth.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.40,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Never heard that before. \NThere's actually a word for them, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.98,0:15:20.40,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for getting so carried away.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.90,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I don't mind. Why, though?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.90,0:15:23.65,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Why what?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.66,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,You have such beautiful hair.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.66,0:15:27.41,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.20,0:15:29.83,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.49,0:15:32.87,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,is there some reason?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.45,0:15:37.37,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Well... don't you think my ears are weird?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.42,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,They're not weird.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.42,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,They're lovely.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.09,0:15:44.01,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,So you're an elf... no, a half-elf, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.51,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,My mother is an elf.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.76,0:15:49.72,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,I've been made fun of all my \Nlife because of these ears.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.68,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I think you're beautiful, Elisa.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.14,0:15:52.51,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.98,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,So what need is there to hide them?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.27,0:16:02.65,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,I-I'm glad you think so, I guess.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.65,0:16:06.11,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,You seem very mature, Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.11,0:16:07.03,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.03,0:16:10.03,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Yeah. You don't look like you're my age.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:10.62,0:16:14.95,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,Jeez, kid, you act way too old for your age.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.33,0:16:16.54,Flashback,Howard,0,0,0,,You're too mature!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.17,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I guess I do get that a lot.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.54,0:16:21.79,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.22,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Thank you for talking to me today, Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.22,0:16:29.01,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Same to you. I look forward to \Nspending more time together.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.76,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Um... See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.76,0:16:32.47,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.10,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.10,0:16:40.65,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.81,0:16:44.57,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,You're Evi Armstrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.03,0:16:47.15,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Call me "Evi," Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.36,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Oh? I appreciate the invitation.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.95,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,I'm not like those noble kids.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.29,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're an ordinary.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:55.74,0:16:58.29,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,There's only one thing I believe in.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.80,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,I knew it! Just like I thought!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.09,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Evi, you're...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.18,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,You've got some nice bulk.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.22,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.01,0:17:17.93,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,You're welcome here, Ray!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.60,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Thanks! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.07,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.70,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.74,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting anyone to be here.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.25,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.54,0:17:41.04,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Running so early in the \Nmorning is very impressive.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.25,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Are you an incoming student?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.09,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes. My name is Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.75,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh! You're Ray White?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.75,0:17:49.26,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,You know of me?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.26,0:17:53.47,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,The academy's first ordinary. \NYou're very famous.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:53.47,0:17:54.76,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.72,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,My name is Rebecca Bradley. I'm a third-year.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.77,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Feel free to call me "Rebecca."
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.27,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'll do that, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.11,Dialogue,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Good, Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.82,0:18:10.53,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Bradley? That's one of the \Ntop three noble families!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.53,0:18:11.78,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Top three noble families?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.82,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,You really don't know?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.07,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Well, I grew up in the countryside.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.07,0:18:17.87,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I don't know much about the nobility.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.33,0:18:21.20,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Rose, Bradley, and Olgren.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.33,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Those three families are as \Npowerful as the royal family,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.33,0:18:28.17,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,with just as much influence over politics,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.88,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,the economy, and everything \Nelse in this country.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.13,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,That's who the top three noble families are.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.97,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,So Amelia is...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.97,0:18:37.05,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,The eldest daughter of the Rose family, \Nthe highest of the three.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.05,0:18:41.77,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,She's got spotless integrity, high morals, \Nand first-rate sorcerer skills.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.77,0:18:44.77,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,She's a genuine, born-and-bred lady.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.19,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Evi, you can go on ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.03,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.82,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,The instructor wanted to see me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.82,0:18:55.11,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Okay. Remember, first period \Nis practical swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.87,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,We'll have to change, so get there early.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.87,0:18:57.57,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.95,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.92,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.09,0:19:10.71,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.71,0:19:14.09,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,My apologies. I was just \Nwalking like normal, though...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.09,0:19:16.80,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Well, I was running because \NI was kind of in a hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.55,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,So you should have moved aside!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:18.55,0:19:22.43,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Uh-huh... That's awfully \Nunreasonable, but I do apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.93,0:19:25.64,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,You're weird. Wait...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.31,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Aren't you that ordinary?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.19,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm Ray White. Nice to meet you,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.61,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,my charming, pigtailed lady.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:32.40,0:19:35.11,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Well, you certainly know just where to look!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.11,0:19:37.99,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,You actually recognized the \Ngreatness of these pigtails!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.99,0:19:38.82,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.74,0:19:41.99,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I am the first and the last,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.37,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,the girl of transcendent, raging cuteness...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.58,0:19:48.92,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,The girl who loves and \Nis loved by pigtails...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.92,0:19:53.00,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I am Claris Cleve...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.97,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,land!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.80,0:19:58.68,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Wow, how nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.05,0:20:01.60,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm not familiar with \Nthe "Cleve Land" family,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.60,0:20:03.39,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,but I hope we can get along.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.31,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,What?! You don't know the Clevelands?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.31,0:20:10.15,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I grew up in the countryside, \Nso I don't know much about the nobility.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.65,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I see. Well, that's fine... yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.61,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,It's a pretty well-known family, though...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.61,0:20:18.95,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I see... You don't know us, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.95,0:20:21.66,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,But I'm sure it's a beautiful family.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.66,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,That's clear just from looking at you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.16,0:20:25.08,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,You can tell?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.96,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Oh, very well, then!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.96,0:20:31.42,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I'll grant you special permission \Nto call me "Claris," Ray!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.42,0:20:34.63,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,I appreciate that. \NI hope we'll get along, Claris.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.34,0:20:37.76,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll let you get along with me!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.55,0:20:40.89,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Anyway, weren't you in a hurry?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.89,0:20:42.01,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.01,0:20:44.06,Dialogue,Claris,0,0,0,,Well, bye! See you later!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.06,0:20:44.60,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.90,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Welcome, Ray.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.61,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again, Colonel.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.61,0:20:57.19,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,None of that, now. You and I have \Nboth retired from the service.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.19,0:20:59.11,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,What shall I call you, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.61,0:21:00.70,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Just "Abbie."
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.91,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,Am înțeles, Abbie.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.37,0:21:06.79,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Nu te-ai schimbat deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.79,0:21:09.50,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,That part of you is so much like him.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.71,0:21:13.54,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,It brings back memories, doesn't it, Abbie?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.54,0:21:14.46,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Uh, hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.55,0:21:18.59,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Albert Alium and Ray White.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.64,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,This is no more than a mock battle.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.64,0:21:23.85,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,If it looks like it's getting \Ndangerous, I'll stop you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.01,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Withered.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.10,Main - Top,Students,0,0,0,,Hah, the Withered!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:26.31,0:21:28.02,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,Who the heck said he was good, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.43,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Withered?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.19,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,They call him the "Withered Wizard."
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.19,0:21:32.85,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.85,0:21:35.52,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,I'm Ray's bosom buddy, Evi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.52,0:21:38.82,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Oh, well, hello... But what does that mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.61,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,It's wordplay.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.49,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,"Withered" and "Wizard"...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.95,0:21:45.08,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,They're practically the same word.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.08,0:21:46.87,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.20,Italics,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.79,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Okay, are you both ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.79,0:21:53.79,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,Someone who can't even use sorcery...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.63,Dialogue,Elliot,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.63,0:21:57.05,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,...has no right to stand \Non the same level as me!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.26,Dialogue,Amelia,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.47,Dialogue,Evi,0,0,0,,Not bad, man!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.47,0:22:06.47,Dialogue,Cusuechs/Zuina,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.72,0:22:07.51,Dialogue,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.14,0:22:10.85,Dialogue,Ray,0,0,0,,That doesn't have too much influence on me.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.06,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,You... You...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.60,0:22:17.32,Dialogue,Albert,0,0,0,,You damned Withered!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.99,0:22:25.91,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.91,0:22:27.03,Dialogue,Students,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.24,0:22:32.54,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you enjoying \Nyour student life,
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.58,0:22:35.96,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Ray White...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.92,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,the Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:49.99,0:23:54.45,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Students! This is the preview for \N{\i1}The Iceblade Sorcerer Shall Rule the World{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.00,0:23:56.96,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Having quietly made up his mind,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:56.96,0:23:59.29,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Ray heads to the place that's a sanctuary\N for fierce, impassioned muscle men,
Dialogue: 99,0:23:59.29,0:24:02.46,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,and a garden for pure, elegant young ladies.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:02.46,0:24:06.09,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest \NSorcerer Begins His Practical Exercises."
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.68,0:24:09.26,Dialogue,Abbie,0,0,0,,Abbie Garnet, signing off!
